Transaction Coordinator  
        |  
TerminalService  
        |  
+-----------------------------+  
| TerminalAdapter interface   |  
| connect()                   |  
| capabilities()              |  
| execute(command, idempotencyKey)  
| observeEvents()             |  
| cancel()                    |  
| disconnect()                |  
+-----------------------------+  
   |          |          |  
